        "sid": "NUM 18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "18",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi yasisithi kuAroni: Wena, lamadodana akho, lesizwe sikayihlo, lizakuthwala ububi obenziwayo endlini engcwele; futhi wena lamadodana akho lizakuthwala ububi ngobupristi benu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labafowenu, isizwe sakoLevi, esiyisizwe sikayihlo, kabafike lawe ukuba bahlangane lawe, bakusize wena lamadodana akho ngaphambi kwethente lobufakazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bazakukusiza, benze yonke imisebenzi yethente; kodwa kabayikusondela ezitsheni zendlu engcwele lasealtareni, ukuze bangafi, lani lingafi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bazahlangana lawe, balondoloze ithente lokuhlangana kuyo yonke inkonzo yethente; kodwa omunye umuntu ongelasikhundla kayikusondela kuwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lizakwenza imisebenzi yendlu engcwele lemisebenzi yealtare, ukuba ulaka lukaNkulunkulu lungabe lusaba khona phezu kwabakoIsrayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khangelani, ngithethe amaLevi angabazalwane benu phakathi kwabakoIsrayeli; ayisipho kini, enikelwe eNkosini ukwenza inkonzo yethente lokuhlangana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wena lamadodana akho lizakwenza imisebenzi yenu yobupristi kukho konke okuqondene lealtare lalokho okungaphakathi kweveli, likhonze. Ngiyalinika ubupristi bube yisipho; kodwa umuntu ongelasikhundla osondelayo uzakubulawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi yathi kuAroni: Mina Nkosi ngikunike ukuba uphathe iminikelo enikelwe kimi, zonke izinto ezingcwele zabakoIsrayeli; ngizinikile wena lamadodana akho zibe yisabelo senu, ngesimiso esingelakuphela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lokhu kuzakuba ngokwakho ezintweni ezingcwele kakhulu, ezingafakwa emlilweni wealtare; yonke iminikelo yabo, layo yonke iminikelo yabo yempuphu, layo yonke iminikelo yabo yesono, layo yonke iminikelo yabo yecala abayinikela kimi, izakuba ngcwele kakhulu, ibe ngeyakho leyamadodana akho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lizakudla lokhu njengokufaneleyo; bonke abesilisa bangakudla; kungcwele kuwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Futhi kungokwakho lalokhu, iminikelo yonke yokuzunguzwa yabantu bakoIsrayeli. Ngikunikile wena lamadodana akho lamadodakazi akho ngesimiso esingelakuphela. Bonke abahlambulukileyo endlini yakho bangakudla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lonke ikhethelo lamafutha, lekhethelo lonke lewayini, lekhethelo lonke lamabele, lengqabutho yalokho abakunikela eNkosini, ngiyakunika khona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ingqabutho yakho konke okuvuthwayo kuqala emasimini abo abayiletha eNkosini izakuba ngeyakho. Bonke abahlambulukileyo endlini yakho bangakudla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Konke okwahlukaniselwe uNkulunkulu koIsrayeli kuzakuba ngokwakho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.27.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Levi 27:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wonke amazibulo abawanikela eNkosini, awabantu lawezifuyo, azakuba ngawakho; kodwa izibulo lomuntu ubolihlenga, lezibulo lenyamazana engcolileyo ubolihlenga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ubolihlenga enyangeni yokuzalwa kwalo ngemali yesiliva ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " amahlanu, ngokweshekeli lendlu engcwele ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " angamatshumi amabili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa izibulo lenkomo lezibulo lemvu, lezibulo lembuzi ungawahlengi, ngoba angcwele. Uzakukhaphazela igazi lawo ealtareni, utshise amahwahwa awo abe ngumnikelo owenziwe ngomlilo, kube liphunga elimnandi eNkosini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa inyama yawo izakuba ngeyakho, lesifuba esizunguziweyo lomlenze wokunene kungokwakho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yonke iminikelo engcwele abakoIsrayeli abayinikela eNkosini ngiyayinika wena lamadodana akho lamadodakazi akho ngesimiso esingelakuphela. Lokhu kuyisivumelwano setshwayi esingelakuphela phambi kweNkosi kuwe lakuyo inzalo yakho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi yathi kuAroni: Kawuzukuba lelifa elizweni lakini, kawuzukuba lesabelo selizwe phakathi kwabo; mina ngiyisabelo sakho lelifa lakho phakathi kwabantu bakoIsrayeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngikunike amaLevi konke okwetshumi koIsrayeli kube ngokwawo, ngomsebenzi wawo awenzayo, ngenkonzo yawo ethenteni lokuhlangana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.27.30+LEV.27.31+LEV.27.32+LEV.27.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Levi 27:30–33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.14.22+DEU.14.23+DEU.14.24+DEU.14.25+DEU.14.26+DEU.14.27+DEU.14.28+DEU.14.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dute 14:22–29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kusukela khathesi abantu bakoIsrayeli bangabe besasondela ethenteni lokuhlangana ukuba bangoni, bangafi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa amaLevi azakwenza inkonzo yethente lokuhlangana, athwale ububi ngayo. Kuzakuba yisimiso esingelakuphela ezizukulwaneni zenu; phakathi kwabakoIsrayeli kawazukuba lelifa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngoba okwetshumi kwabakoIsrayeli abakunikela eNkosini kube ngumnikelo, ngikunike amaLevi kube ngokwawo. Ngakho ngitshilo ngawo ukuthi kawazukuba lelifa phakathi kwabakoIsrayeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
